  m_Name: 03_Kalaw_nasayaat_ak_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Kalaw
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'When someone asks you ''kumusta ka?'', you can tell them how you''re
    doing.

    In Ilokano, ''nasayaat ak'' means ''I''m fine'' or ''I''m doing well.''

    For
    example, if someone asks how your journey is going, you can answer: ''Nasayaat
    ak.''

    Listen carefully: nasayaat ak.

    Now, try saying ''nasayaat ak''
    yourself.'
